{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7168eb07d8764d15d94309ebbce6b7163f6f81971d7152dc01d87bc7d9eb145a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d8ad83f6f14ff0500887cebf408c5501f576e595c2cc53a486af2c57f6ba031",
      "text": "独一无二的生日会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:414676055bb70528a531c4b97648cd83c24097badb1b14b77951cc6c7ad14d54",
      "text": "课程结束后，诚司递给英雄、龙和\n制作人一个信封。\n那是天音为诚司准备的生日会的\n邀请函。上面写着天音提出的\n可爱“请求”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9096bf965e1eafc13630879113afc1b2c56011be71cce6b42daaa3d253083be7",
      "text": "今天带去的东西，只要这个生日派对的\n装饰和礼物就够了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df4ffb257c257264be2c72377f97a742bc30ba2a73bf0fbfe31204b47f7c77cb",
      "text": "好的！都装在那个袋子里了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7e2cced377c6d5a924b46ef23108a9e024b55e835556fa02f556c609235274c",
      "text": "制作人好像还在工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d04b085de2921ba985bb85f476e293337c5807ddde9b5f4c8afe4da213afc7c0",
      "text": "离约定时间还有富余，\n先确认一下有没有少带什么东西吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73cfdc832833d9e464d46afda762c5a94b926969e5f50ad0ffb7fe589d2e6303",
      "text": "好的！就这么办吧。\n说不定还会想到其他需要的东西呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1d89e35ded7a5a59b5f1110929e1ed29c64796fc9817208b2b9981fc6564eb0",
      "text": "马上就是信玄的生日会了啊。\n我现在就开始期待了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e63a82457ecdfc234e9a6c5e5a90ac6fb82e1be786c2860baadc13a106cb532",
      "text": "我也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b97f0d1930dde97c104703653bdc37ba526b6f6a41eea689f4ef70536ceb4b1",
      "text": "天音特别有干劲。\n据说每天都在琢磨要做什么样的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40723a23a354b102c1b32371d350b11c306671c00dbb614c5dc1dbd4a6b8e836",
      "text": "听你这么一说，\n我越来越期待了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:275c93535712f652e9846ecae5baec6b036dc1a2143420a123a6ad8a3eec5903",
      "text": "替我向天音酱问好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e8c9cd3846c06ce97d07c0fe947c2e83e89bc160566ce7f75ab0c9e548e8190",
      "text": "天音听说龙君会来生日会，\n特别高兴……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:213260d241c9024399a82330a991d66c1da0028f1e56ddfcdf0c90ee4c2df172",
      "text": "那太好了！\n……咦，等等？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eafbb4d760014aa7c2480085b17c3a78b014ea68078c4f1ccd45d662574e9ed6",
      "text": "诚司先生，你的表情好吓人啊！\n发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27ffb72e3eda13b981d9370bb57c28eb9e0478dbc959356a28bcb942ea86b9da",
      "text": "抱歉，我不知不觉就绷紧了脸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47914abe2f848dec1cfbca21e33059bca5ce60ddcc1ddd2fc85518338d5a8321",
      "text": "天音那么开心，我也很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
